  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár ta ooaan ala? An baraá tlakweemaá wa kumiitána as gurtleemu iwa ak doogin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aasla'áy a adoosingeeká. Ateéká' aga qatlaan dír tlakweemaawo, ala adór atén tar malé baraá tlakweemaá wa hootaan a adoomá? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' kaangwí u xuá'aáke adór qoomár atén tiwa baatimiís as tawa dinku'uumisaan nee Kristo, a tina baatimiís as tawa dinku'uumisaan nee gwa'araarós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén tina baatimiís as tiwa haragaasi nee Kristo, nee gwa'araarós kawa dinku'uusaan. Ala ar loohír baatiísmoorene atén tina al foól nee inós, gwa'arár inós ira gwaá' an toorén, as atén tawa hootaán ar slafíngw /abén, adór Kristo kungura waaslee/atís baraá gwa'arár wa ale ar aleesleemuú Mungú nee xirfuuwós.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma adoodá' atén tira haragaasaán nee inós, qoomár tawa qatlaán ar adoodá' inós ira gwaá', atén tiqo malé haragaasaán nee inós ar tawa waaslee/aan sleeme ar adoodá' inós ira waasleé/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A xuaán adór muneerén tidár aáng kara kikií' dinkwa nee Kristo. Gaarí gár isa tleehharút as /uuruuduú tlakweema baraarén i dirií' masók ku hhitín, as atén mawa malé lawaalér tlakweema tleehhitaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma heé aa gwaa', inós kwaa gweér baraá lawaali'iimár tlakweemaawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala atén barnaxes aga qatlaán dinkwa nee Kristo, a haratlintatiaán adór atén tar slafaán sleeme dinkwa nee inós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee slám a xuaán Kristo, alaá waasle/uuwose i malé gwaaiiká, slám inós i malé baloó dahiiká baraá /uuruú gwa'araaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma inós iwa gwaá', a ina sagaáwa wák wa gwaá' as daanduú tlakweema. Nee slafingwdá' hamí ir slafi, in slaaf as Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe kuungá' sleeme masók tin harafaditá' tawa múk aa qaatl dír tlakweemaawo, nee tawa múk slaáf dír Munguhe baraá Kristo Yesuwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe kuungá' ma ya/aamara' tlakweema slaqoohúng kuká' qatlá' ngiwa baaliya', nee ilatleerír slaqwa kawa eeharahada'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee slám kuungá' slaqoohúng mi hanmiisara' as kiwa ar gadiyuusi nee tlakweema, tawa adór xooslár tlehhma'aá ganaa'a'aaká. Ala kuungá' ti kiloohúng hanise' dír gadiyér Mungú i alé, as kuungá' Mungú kuwa sagadiyusa' ar slaqoohúng, slaqoohúng tawa adór xooslár tlehhma'aá ganaa'á'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma kuungá' tlakweema nu aleeslay'aaká nuwa sa waawuti'ina'. Asma kuungá' dír tay dir'a' a baraá waawuti'iimár hara'ayarooká, ala kuungá' a baraá waawuti'iimár gurtleemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoorí gídaabárós a milá? A tlakweema in tleehhána as adoodá' atén tawa baraá waawuti'iimár hara'ayarooká, ala tawa baraá waawuti'iimár gurtleemu? Aasla'áy, adoosingeeká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuungá' kaangwí u xuá'aáke? Kuungá' bir taa kiloohúng hanisé' amór aakooko as kuwa sagadiyusa', nee kuwa iialooeemisa', kuungá' daqaní a lawaalér heedaádá' ta iialooeemisa'. Kuungá' bar lawaalér tlakweema, lawaali'iimarí gár i hup a gwa'ara, ala bar lawaalér iialooeemis, lawaali'iimarí gár i hup a gan'amu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Mungú ku xirfayeesi. Asma kuungá' aáng a lawaalér tlakweema. Ala hamí intsaahhasadá' taa ilaoté', aga ló'wa iialooesé' ar mune sleémeero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hám kuungá' tunda baraá lawaali'iimár tlakweemaá wa gweér, nee daxta kuungá' a lawaalér gan'amu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tí ana oó' ar slaqsoó slafíngw muu, asma kuungá' kawa tsatsahhaanda'aaká. Kuungá' aáng slaqoohúng ina hanisé' kiwa ar gadiyuusi nee slasla/ara nee dee/aanu. Tlehhmuú adoorí dee/aanu nguri huúw baraá slafingwhunge. Ala hám daxta kuungá' slaqoohúng na haniisaak kiwa ar gadiyuusi nee gan'amu. Tlehhmuú adoorí gár ni huwi a hhoohhooeesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár kuungá' tawa lawaalér tlakweema, qoomaadaádae kuungá' gan'amu ugwa sagadiyusi'iiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomaadaádae gár taa sleeré' a milá? Gár taa sleeré' a muruuwí hám ta sa murumitá'aáke. Ala alhhe'eesoó muruuwí a gwa'ara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala hamí, kuungá' bar tunda gweér baraá lawaali'iimár tlakweemaawo, nee tunduri lawaalér Mungú tleéhh, gár ta sleera' a muruudá' hhoohhooeesár huwahuúw. Nee alhhe'eesaywós a slafíngw alhhe'eesay wásl un sleerá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma bu'utuú tlakweema a gwa'ara, ala gár Mungú atén tir qay a slafíngw alhhe'eesay wásl baraá Kristo Yesu Aakoorén.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.6.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
